%95%B4%E5%A4%87%EF%BC%9A%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%E7%AF%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【内容前瞻】极心测试出航整备：情报篇\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：谜之猫本喵<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-25 20:02<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FQCBsPnqvb6xfvSt6-rCKyg\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QCBsPnqvb6xfvSt6-rCKyg</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息192.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>喵~<br />\n关于本喵是怎么<font color=\"blue\"><b>来到这个世界</b></font>的<br />\n昨天和这个世界的人类小场记解释了一整天<br />\n她摸了摸<font color=\"blue\"><b>所剩不多的头发</b></font>思考了片刻<br />\n就拜托我多带一些<font color=\"blue\"><b>情报</b></font>过来\n<br /><br />\n算了算了<br />\n毕竟本喵<font color=\"blue\"><b>也不是什么魔鬼</b></font><br />\n这份<font color=\"blue\"><b>情报</b></font>收好了\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息237.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0d/savz9ap0m7gfzx53z467dfra4rma12n.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF237.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"1877\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0d/savz9ap0m7gfzx53z467dfra4rma12n.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF237.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0d/savz9ap0m7gfzx53z467dfra4rma12n.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"3619\" /><img alt=\"官方消息238.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6c/ewpfolvx43din2587s9ddg565ip5ohu.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF238.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"1229\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6c/ewpfolvx43din2587s9ddg565ip5ohu.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF238.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6c/ewpfolvx43din2587s9ddg565ip5ohu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"2371\" /><img alt=\"官方消息239.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/97/rb0ik175smcsnbt7xzqgmyxlegnauj0.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF239.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"2796\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/97/rb0ik175smcsnbt7xzqgmyxlegnauj0.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF239.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/97/rb0ik175smcsnbt7xzqgmyxlegnauj0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"5392\" />\n<br /><br />\n别的世界线的人类虽然已经提前见到本喵了<br />\n但是放心，<font color=\"blue\"><b>本喵还等着你</b></font>呢！<br />\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>新的旅程</b></font>就要开启了！<br />\n别忘了给本喵带<font color=\"blue\"><b>纪念品</b></font>！\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 96/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2731/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 262/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.744      1 -total\n 54.08%   17.708      1 模板:文章戳\n 45